# fifo_child_report_mismatch_dies: A report of stamp waits (0x1028 on a FIFO that is not faulted) looks each waiting stampIndex up as a child id and asserts that the child there has that stampIndex. Child 1 with stampIndex 3 blocks on a barrier (registering stampIndex 3 as waiting; the scenario waits 500 ms for it), child 3 has stampIndex 5: 0x1028 = 2 then kills the host.
